<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's 3-month T-bill yield rises to 22.73 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary's 3-month T-bill yield rises to 22.73 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 22.73 percent, up from 22.51 percent at an auction one week ago, the National Bank of Hungary said  HTBN.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	8,984.88 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    22.73 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     94.6370 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
